    "### Permutation Importance\n",
    "We compute **permutation feature importance** for both models.  \n",
    "This global explainability method measures the drop in performance when a feature’s values are shuffled.  \n",
    "It identifies the most influential features driving predictions, independent of model type.\n"
   ]
